Refactored `src/report.ts`: the three `summarizeBy*` functions were duplicating the same grouping/accumulation loop with only the key differing. Extracted a shared `summarizeBy` helper parameterized by a key-selector function, so each exported function is now a one-line call with the exact same signature and behavior. `order.ts` was already clean (small, single-purpose functions, no duplication), so no changes were needed there. All tests pass, including the `report` suite that exercises these functions.
